---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
import Trust from '../../components/Trust.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Value-based care"
  description="A full cross-setting record for the populations you are accountable for, and early warning of costly events."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Markets · Value-based care"
    title="Accountable for a population. Blind to half the journey."
    lede="Lattix gives risk-bearing organizations a cross-setting record and alerts when enrolled patients hit the ED, the hospital, or another clinic."
    image="/images/network-city.jpg"
  />

  <section class="bg-paper px-5 py-24 sm:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
      <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-ink/8 bg-cream p-8">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl">The complete record</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
            Quality measures, risk adjustment, and care management fail when the chart is only what
            happened inside your four walls. Pull medications, problems, labs, imaging, and
            encounters from the lattice.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-ink/8 bg-cream p-8">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl">The moment something happens</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
            ADT and clinical alerts so coordinators reach a member after discharge — not after the
            readmission. One third of PCPs are never told their patient was admitted. You can be.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-ink/8 bg-paper p-6">
          <h3 class="font-medium">Eliminate duplicative tests</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/65">See the imaging and labs already done before you order them again.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-ink/8 bg-paper p-6">
          <h3 class="font-medium">Risk scores that hold up</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/65">Clinical data plus claims, normalized, for a defensible picture of risk.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-ink/8 bg-paper p-6">
          <h3 class="font-medium">Virtual care coordination</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/65">Histories and medications before the encounter. Alerts after it.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Trust />
  <CTA />
</Base>
